OL,5,G0030 Through the Night
OL,6,     FThe Polish National Radio Symphony
OL,7,     FOrchestra, Katowice with conductor
OL,8,     FMarin Alsop, play Bacewicz's
OL,9,     FSymphony No 1. The concert also
OL,10,     Ffeatures Mahler's Symphony No 1 in
OL,11,     FD 'Titan'.
OL,12,G0630 Breakfast
OL,13,     FHannah French presents Radio 3's
OL,14,     FBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,15,     Femail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,16,G0900 Saturday Morning
OL,17,     FNicky Spence plays the best
OL,18,     Fclassical music and meets the
OL,19,     Fmusicians who make it happen,
OL,20,     Fincluding rising star
OL,21,     Fmezzo-soprano Aigul Akhmetshina.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG1/6
