OL,5,G1200 Earlier... with Jools Holland
OL,6,     FJools is joined by percussionist
OL,7,     Fand film producer Ray Cooper.
OL,8,G1300 Key Changes: Radio 3's...
OL,9,     F...Essential History of Classical
OL,10,     FMusic. 1814, Vienna. As Europe's
OL,11,     Fleaders gather for the Congress of
OL,12,     FVienna, a fashionable new dance is
OL,13,     Fcapturing the imagination of
OL,14,     Fballroom crowds.
OL,15,G1400 Record Review
OL,16,     FSarah Walker selects the best new
OL,17,     Fclassical releases and is joined
OL,18,     Fby Emily MacGregor, who shares her
OL,19,     F5 favourite recordings of music by
OL,20,     Fthis week's Proms Composer:
OL,21,     FProkofiev.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG2/6
