OL,5,G1600 BBC Proms 2026
OL,6,     FHuw Stephens explores connections
OL,7,     Fbetween music and literature on
OL,8,     Fthe theme of Welsh myth and
OL,9,     Flegend. Live from Theatr Clwyd
OL,10,     Fwith Sinfonia Cymru, Owen Teale
OL,11,     Fand Sian-Reese Williams.
OL,12,G1730 This Classical Life
OL,13,     FJess Gillam sits down for a
OL,14,     Flistening party with the Canadian
OL,15,     Fbaritone Gerald Finley. They share
OL,16,     Fmusic by Mozart, the King's
OL,17,     FSingers, Stan Getz, Vivaldi and
OL,18,     FStacey Kent.
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG3/6
